         & = \widehat\varphi_A(\bfy_0) + \widehat\varphi_A(\bfy_0\star\bfy_{1,1}) + \widehat\varphi_A(\bfy_0\star\bfy_{2,1}) + \widehat\varphi_A(\bfy_0\star\bfy_{2,2}) + \widehat\varphi_A(\bfy_0\star\bfy_{1,1} \star \bfy_{2,1}) + 
