codex
Rejected; no shipping generator is claimed.

The native line-Hadamard family passed G1–G8, including 0/200,000 structure-aware guesses. However:

- Easy: bare oracle pool failed 3/3, but xAI solved the structurally hinted instance.
- Medium: the one permitted escalation was solved bare by Gemini.
- Output limits were not binding.
- The Track B gap was real: 212,015 mechanical operations versus 84 compact operations at easy.

The prior toric-variety proposal is also trivial because toric varieties are Hadamard-idempotent, as explained from the full [paper](https://arxiv.org/abs/2510.05231).

Deliverables:

- [REJECTED.md](/home/gson/gvrepo/results/2510.05231/REJECTED.md)
- [Retained generator](/home/gson/gvrepo/results/2510.05231/rejected_gen_2510_05231.py)
- [Self-test report](/home/gson/gvrepo/results/2510.05231/selftest_report.json)
- [Bare transcript](/home/gson/gvrepo/results/2510.05231/llm_loop_transcript.jsonl)
- [Hinted transcript](/home/gson/gvrepo/results/2510.05231/g9_hinted_transcript.jsonl)
- [Medium bare transcript](/home/gson/gvrepo/results/2510.05231/medium_bare_transcript.jsonl)

The placebo arm was not run because the gated hinted failure—and then the bare medium solve—already made rejection mandatory.
